.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
background-handler providing pseudo-transparency 

this plugin provides pseudo-transparency, so you will see the 'root-window' -- the desktop -- shining through, but not other windows.
.PP
properties:
.IP "\(bu" 2
backgroundtintalpha
.IP "\(bu" 2
backgroundtintcolour
.PP

